flowchart TD
    A([Code pushed / PR raised]) --> B[Application Jenkinsfile triggers<br/>imports shared aiBuildFix Groovy library]
    B --> C[Pipeline stages run:<br/>Checkout → Build → Test → Package]
    C --> D{post block:<br/>Build result?}

    %% ---------------- SUCCESS PATH ----------------
    D -- SUCCESS --> E[No AI action needed]
    E --> F[Idle/watch timer starts]
    F --> G([Auto-terminate after 5 min<br/>no lingering monitor process])

    %% ---------------- FAILURE PATH ----------------
    D -- FAILURE --> H[/post-failure block calls:<br/>sharedLib.aiBuildFix params/]
    H --> H1[["Params passed:<br/>• targetBranch<br/>• fixMode: newBranch / sameBranch<br/>• maxRetries<br/>• notifyChannel<br/>• llmModel"]]
    H1 --> I[[Triggers downstream:<br/>AI Build Fix Pipeline]]

    subgraph AIFIX [AI Build Fix Pipeline — separate job, avoids deadlock]
        I --> J[Stage 1: Fetch failed build logs<br/>via Jenkins REST API]
        J --> K[Stage 2: Send logs to LLM]
        K --> L[LLM returns:<br/>failure category + root cause + proposed fix]
        L --> M{fixMode config?}
        M -- newBranch --> N1[Create/checkout branch<br/>e.g. fix/ai-auto]
        M -- sameBranch --> N2[Apply patch directly<br/>on the working branch]
        N1 --> O[Stage 3: Commit fix]
        N2 --> O
        O --> P[Trigger rebuild of<br/>original application pipeline]
        P --> Q{Rebuild result?}
    end

    %% ---------------- REBUILD OUTCOMES ----------------
    Q -- SUCCESS --> R{Which fixMode<br/>was used?}
    R -- newBranch --> S[Open merge request<br/>against target branch]
    R -- sameBranch --> T[Fix already committed<br/>in place]
    S --> U([Notify developer:<br/>diagnosis + diff + MR link])
    T --> U
    U --> V([Done — build healthy])

    Q -- STILL FAILING --> W{retries so far <br/>< maxRetries?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Increment retry counter]
    X --> J
    W -- No, limit reached --> Y([Notify developer / on-call:<br/>auto-fix exhausted, manual review needed])
    Y --> V

    %% ---------------- STYLES ----------------
    style G fill:#3ED598,stroke:#2ea876,color:#0a0f1d
    style V fill:#3ED598,stroke:#2ea876,color:#0a0f1d
    style Y fill:#F0616D,stroke:#c94750,color:#0a0f1d
    style D fill:#182240,stroke:#3FD0E0,color:#E7ECF7
    style Q fill:#182240,stroke:#3FD0E0,color:#E7ECF7
    style M fill:#182240,stroke:#9B8CFB,color:#E7ECF7
    style R fill:#182240,stroke:#9B8CFB,color:#E7ECF7
    style W fill:#182240,stroke:#F5A742,color:#E7ECF7
    style H1 fill:#0D1424,stroke:#3FD0E0,color:#B9E4EA
